OL,3,GNEWSABank targeted a second time in
OL,4,Aattempted ram-raid
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bank has been targeted in an
OL,7,Fattempted ram-raid for the second time
OL,8,Fin three years.
OL,10,FCambridgeshire Police said it was
OL,11,Fcalled to the branch of Nationwide in
OL,12,FHigh Causeway in Whittlesey at about
OL,13,F03:00 GMT.
OL,15,FSuspects had fled the scene before
OL,16,Fofficers arrived but nothing was taken,
OL,17,Fthe force said.
OL,19,F"Crimes have been raised for theft of a
OL,20,Fvehicle and criminal damage and
OL,21,Finvestigations are ongoing," it added.
